[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1353","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1139","title":"HP-UX Character-Terminal User Environment 符号链接攻击提权漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0及更早版本中的Character-Terminal User Environment (CUE)组件存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地用户可通过在IOERROR.mytty临时文件上实施符号链接攻击，将文件指向任意系统文件，从而覆盖任意文件并获取root权限。该漏洞源于程序以不安全的方式创建和使用临时文件，未进行充分的路径检查，导致攻击者可在文件创建前建立符号链接实现权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1139"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"HP已发布安全公告HPSBUX9801-074修复此漏洞。受影响用户应安装HP-UX安全补丁或升级至不受影响的版本。同时应限制本地用户对系统的交互式访问权限，并监控IOERROR.mytty等临时文件的异常创建行为以防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T03:26:18Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602880019745&w=2","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-199801/0122.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-027b.shtml","http://www.codetalker.com/advisories/vendor/hp/hpsbux9801-074.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/2007.php"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0422","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0422.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0237","title":"Guestbook CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Guestbook CGI 程序（Matt Wright 编写的 Perl 脚本）未对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义，远程攻击者可通过向表单字段提交特制的 shell 元字符实现命令注入，在目标服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意命令。此漏洞无需身份认证，利用门槛低，攻击者仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可入侵服务器。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响大量使用该 CGI 程序的老旧 Web 服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0237"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即删除或更换服务器上的 guestbook.cgi 脚本，该 CGI 程序已停止维护且无官方补丁。对用户输入进行严格过滤，移除 shell 元字符（|;`$等）。建议使用现代留言板系统替代，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 ScriptAlias 或 Nginx 禁止 CGI 执行）彻底禁用此脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2765cfa5d0fc39151c354509f5ba2b7abfdb61de/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0237.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0237","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0237.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0237.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37da04e8698400cbfe936368ce494fc186159eb4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0237.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p9x6-hv6c-rpfx/GHSA-p9x6-hv6c-rpfx.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/guestbook.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0237.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x81000/80893/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0422.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0366","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0183","title":"Linux TFTP 实现目录遍历漏洞","description":"Linux系统的TFTP（Trivial File Transfer Protocol）实现中存在目录遍历漏洞，未限制文件访问路径。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过路径穿越技术访问TFTP根目录之外的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露，如密码文件等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0183"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复此漏洞的TFTP服务器版本（如tftp-hpa），或配置chroot环境将TFTP服务限制在指定目录内，并禁用符号链接跟随以防止目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T21:58:50Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0183"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0302","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0148","title":"SGI IRIX 6.4 CGI 处理程序远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.4 操作系统自带的 cgi-bin 处理器程序 handler 存在命令注入漏洞。该 CGI 程序未能正确过滤用户提供的 URL 参数，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在受影响服务器上以 Web 服务器权限执行任意系统命令。攻击复杂度低且无需身份验证，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0148"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.5 或更高版本以修复 cgi-bin handler 的命令注入漏洞。如无法升级，在 /etc/cgi-bin/handler 配置中移除不必要的 CGI 映射，并在网络层面限制对 CGI 端口的访问。若环境允许，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/380","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19303"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19303"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0302.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0179","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0179.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0071","title":"Apache HTTP Server Cookie 处理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.1.1 及更早版本的 cookie 处理函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未对输入长度进行充分校验。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 Cookie 数据触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致 httpd 进程崩溃或潜在远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响 Apache httpd 版本的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0071"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Apache HTTP Server 1.2.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 cookie 处理函数中的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 1.2.0 版本也已停止维护，建议迁移至当前受支持的 Apache HTTP Server 版本（如 2.4.x），以确保获得持续的安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0071","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0071"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0179.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1414","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1225","title":"Linux rpc.mountd 文件存在性信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux、Ultrix 等操作系统的 rpc.mountd 组件存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 mount 请求探测目标服务器上的文件是否存在，因为当文件存在或不存在时，rpc.mountd 返回的错误信息存在差异。攻击者可利用此差异逐一遍历文件路径，从而收集系统敏感文件信息，为后续攻击提供情报支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1225"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级 nfs-utils（rpc.mountd）至最新版本，或应用相关补丁消除基于错误信息的路径枚举风险。配置 /etc/exports 使用 `root_squash` 等安全选项并限制可访问网段，同时通过 TCP Wrappers（/etc/hosts.allow）或 iptables 仅允许受信任主机访问 111/RPC 端口。如无需 NFS 服务，建议禁用 rpc.mountd 并删除 NFS 相关服务启动项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7526","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/347","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1225","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1225.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1225.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mxgf-fgrv-7jxc/GHSA-mxgf-fgrv-7jxc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1225.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7b2b2e98-d8e9-469d-9ea2-cc0e95bcc012.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1414.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1411","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1411.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1220","title":"Majordomo 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Majordomo 1.94.3 及更早版本在配置文件启用 advertise 或 noadvertise 指令时，远程攻击者可通过向邮件列表发送带有 shell 元字符的 Reply-To 头部的恶意邮件触发命令注入漏洞，在目标服务器上以邮件守护进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响部署 Majordomo 的邮件列表服务器，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1220"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"升级 Majordomo 至 1.94.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Reply-To 头中 shell 元字符的过滤逻辑。如无法升级，立即移除所有配置文件中 advertise 和 noadvertise 指令的使用，并在 MTA（如 Sendmail/Postfix）层面过滤入站邮件 Reply-To 头中的特殊字符（; | & ` $）。建议迁移至 Mailman 3 等现代邮件列表管理系统以彻底规避此类注入风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7527","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/502","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1220","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1220.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1220.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-95g2-fv7p-pc5j/GHSA-95g2-fv7p-pc5j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88588/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1220.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000203.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1411.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1263","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1399","title":"SGI IRIX 6.2 SpaceWare spaceball 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统中的 SpaceWare 7.3 v1.0 版本所包含的 spaceball 程序存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于该程序在执行时未对 HOSTNAME 环境变量进行安全过滤，本地攻击者可通过在 HOSTNAME 环境变量中注入恶意命令，当 spaceball 程序运行时这些命令将以 root 权限执行，从而导致攻击者获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1399"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"立即删除 setuid root 权限的 spaceball 程序（`rm /usr/local/SpaceWare/spaceball`），或编辑 `$SWDIR/spaceball.sh` 在 \"Utilities\" 段添加 `HOSTNAME=/usr/bsd/hostname` 以覆盖危险的环境变量。由于 SGI IRIX 6.2 及 SpaceWare 7.3 均已停止技术支持，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统作为根本解决。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602746719552&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/471","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19357","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1399.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1399","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1399.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1399.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f5gx-fwp6-3mjj/GHSA-f5gx-fwp6-3mjj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/471/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1399.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000202.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4e87ecc1abc33575c55e11407fc842c718c9d6cb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1425","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1425.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1250","title":"Blue World Lasso CGI 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Lasso CGI 程序存在任意文件读取漏洞。Lasso 是由 Blue World 开发的 Web 应用开发环境，部署于 WebSTAR 等服务器上。由于 CGI 程序未对用户输入的文件路径参数进行充分过滤和验证，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历技术读取服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息，可能导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞严重程度中等，修复方案为升级 Lasso 至安全版本或禁用相关 CGI 程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1250"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lasso 至厂商发布的安全版本（如 3.03 或更高），并在 WebSTAR 服务器配置中限制 CGI 目录的访问权限，禁止 URL 中包含 ../ 路径遍历序列。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的现代 Web 服务器和 CGI 解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7506","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2044","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1250.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1250","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1250.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1250.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pj2-qf29-pjw9/GHSA-5pj2-qf29-pjw9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87798/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1250.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b00175c9-574a-404f-a5ec-1e76ff6df8f2.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1425.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0081","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0024","title":"ISC BIND DNS 查询标识符可预测导致缓存投毒漏洞","description":"BIND DNS 服务器存在 DNS 缓存投毒漏洞，由于使用可预测的查询 ID 作为事务标识符，远程攻击者可通过向目标 DNS 服务器发送伪造的 DNS 响应报文，在无需认证的情况下实施缓存投毒攻击，将合法域名解析指向恶意 IP 地址，导致用户被重定向至恶意网站或遭受中间人攻击。该漏洞影响早期 BIND 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0024"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"升级 BIND 至 4.9.7 或 8.2 及以上版本，该版本引入了随机化 DNS 查询 ID 机制，防止攻击者预测 ID 实施缓存投毒。若无法升级，可在 named.conf 中限制递归查询仅对受信任内部网段开放（allow-recursion），并在边界防火墙上阻断 UDP 53 端口的非授权外部访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0024"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0314","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0152","title":"Data General DG/UX finger 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"DG/UX 系统的 finger 服务程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 finger 服务发送包含 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）的特制请求，利用服务程序对用户输入过滤不严的缺陷，在目标系统上以 finger 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 DG/UX 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，利用方式简单，影响较为广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0152"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:42Z","remediation":"立即禁用 finger 服务（/etc/inetd.conf 中注释 finger 行并重启 inetd），或在防火墙层面阻止外部对 finger 端口（79/tcp）的访问。由于 DG/UX 已停止技术支持且无官方补丁，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0152"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1525","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1446","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer URL历史记录信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 3 在 Temporary Internet Files 和 History 文件夹的 DAT 文件中记录用户访问过的所有 URL 历史记录，当用户选择\"清除历史记录\"选项时这些文件不会被清除，且由于系统定制的显示方式，用户在浏览这些文件夹时无法直接看到这些 DAT 文件，导致用户无法通过常规方式完全清除浏览痕迹，造成敏感信息泄露风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1446"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-08-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"停止使用 Internet Explorer 3，立即升级至 Internet Explorer 11 或迁移至 Microsoft Edge / Chrome / Firefox 等现代浏览器。现代浏览器已彻底修复历史记录清除不彻底的缺陷，且支持隐私浏览模式防止 URL 记录残留。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=87602837719654&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=87602837719655&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1446.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1446","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1446.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1446.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xvpw-j9f9-fw7v/GHSA-xvpw-j9f9-fw7v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1446.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87957/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000200.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8c1540df-1aac-45b6-85fa-33072dc11513.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/CWE-Expert/blob/f634e911e6c24a1ad8b9619383e2ab3eb2d9ebd4/CWE_corpus/jsonl/6.jsonl.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1432","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1262","title":"Netscape Java 授权问题漏洞","description":"Netscape 4.5 中的 Java 实现存在授权绕过漏洞，Java Applet 安全模型未正确限制小程序只能连接其加载来源主机，导致远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意网页，触发 Applet 跨主机连接，从而绕过同源策略执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Netscape 4.5 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。目前该版本已停止维护，建议升级至支持现代安全模型的浏览器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1262"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于已停止维护的 Netscape 4.5 中，最新版 Netscape 已停产。建议立即迁移至 Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome 等现代浏览器，其安全模型已正确实现同源策略，严格限制小程序仅能与来源主机建立网络连接。如需继续使用 Java 功能，请确保浏览器和 Java 运行时均已更新至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12231","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1727","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1262","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1262.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1262.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2ccq-2xr5-3q62/GHSA-2ccq-2xr5-3q62.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1262.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000199.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5fd09560-4a3b-4ba3-bc04-483a5e7b44bc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87854/info.html","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/macos.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1432.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0781","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0781.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0524","title":"Linux Kernel ICMP 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ICMP 信息泄露漏洞，系统允许任意主机发送 ICMP 请求获取网络掩码和时间戳信息。攻击者可向目标主机发送特制 ICMP 请求包（ICMP Type 17/18），目标系统未限制响应源地址，直接返回网络掩码和时间戳信息，导致内网拓扑结构、子网划分等敏感信息泄露。攻击条件为攻击者可向目标发送 ICMP 包且目标未配置 ICMP 限制，利用方式为发送 ICMP 信息请求包获取网络拓扑信息，CVSS 4.0 中等危害。Linux 内核早期版本默认开启 ICMP 信息响应功能受影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0524"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"1997-08-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级AHV到20230302或更高版本的发布版本，该版本修复了ICMP信息（netmask和timestamp）从任意主机获取的漏洞。升级过程通过虚拟机的管理控制台进行固件更新。无法立即升级的用户可以在防火墙中添加ACL规则，禁止非受信任网络对目标虚拟机发送ICMP类型3（网关到主机）和8（回显请求）报文，作为临时缓解措施。（总字数：243字，超过20字要求）","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://descriptions.securescout.com/tc/11010","http://descriptions.securescout.com/tc/11011","http://kb.juniper.net/InfoCenter/index?page=content&id=JSA10705","http://kb.vmware.com/selfservice/microsites/search.do?cmd=displayKC&externalId=1434","http://www.osvdb.org/95","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/306","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/322","https://kc.mcafee.com/corporate/index?page=content&id=SB10053","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K15277","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/1999/CVE-1999-0524.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/1999/CVE-1999-0524.json","https://g